@page "/profile"

<PageTitle>Nested state</PageTitle>

<h1>Nested state</h1>
<p class="lead">
    <code>ProfileState.User</code> is a reactive object inside a reactive object. Every component depends only on
    what it read: typing a name re-renders the header but not the contact card, and the bio card stops depending
    on <code>Bio</code> while it is hidden. Replacing the whole user updates everything that read through it.
</p>

<div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
        <h2>Edit</h2>
        <ProfileEditor />
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Header</h2>
        <ProfileHeader />
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <ProfileContact />
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Bio</h2>
        <ProfileBio />
    </div>
</div>
